{"sha": "9b87d93312608e6d6bf7677e69c64f7d73e631b326c68bd0a886229e1e226bcd", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g11:fundamental-interactions} 章 --- 基本相互作用}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:fundamental-interactions:1}", "质子：$10^{-15}$（核子尺度）；水分子：$10^{-10}$", "（分子尺度 --- 单个分子处于原子尺度）；沙子：", "$10^{-4}$（日常物质）；地球：$10^{7}$（行星）；银河：", "$10^{21}$（星系）。单位均为米。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:fundamental-interactions:2}", "带负电：它\\emph{得到}了", "$N = \\num{4.8e-9}/\\num{1.6e-19} = \\num{3.0e10}$ 个电子。头发", "带 $+\\qty{4.8e-9}{C}$ 的电荷，由电荷守恒", "（见\\cref{prop:g11:fundamental-interactions:conservation}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:fundamental-interactions:3}", "$F = \\num{8.99e9} \\times \\dfrac{\\num{2.0e-6} \\times \\num{3.0e-6}}{0.30^2}", "= \\dfrac{\\num{5.39e-2}}{0.090} \\approx \\qty{0.60}{N}$，吸引", "（异号电荷），两力大小相等、", "方向相反。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:fundamental-interactions:4}", "$F_0/4$；\\ $9F_0$；\\ $2F_0$；\\ $F_0$（分子 $\\times 4$，分母", "$\\times 4$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:fundamental-interactions:5}", "(a) 万有引力；(b) 电磁相互作用；(c) 强相互作用；(d) 弱相互作用；", "(e) 电磁相互作用。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:fundamental-interactions:6}", "$F_E = \\num{8.99e9} \\times (\\num{1.60e-19})^2/(\\num{2.0e-15})^2", "= \\num{2.30e-28}/\\num{4.0e-30} \\approx \\qty{58}{N}$;", "$F_G = \\num{6.67e-11} \\times (\\num{1.67e-27})^2/\\num{4.0e-30}", "\\approx \\qty{4.7e-35}{N}$。比值 $F_E/F_G \\approx \\num{1.2e36}$。", "强相互作用束缚原子核，引力可忽略。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:fundamental-interactions:7}", "$F_E = \\num{2.30e-28}/(\\num{5.3e-11})^2 = \\num{2.30e-28}/\\num{2.81e-21}", "\\approx \\qty{8.2e-8}{N}$;", "$F_G = \\num{6.67e-11} \\times \\num{1.67e-27} \\times \\num{9.11e-31} /", "\\num{2.81e-21} \\approx \\qty{3.6e-47}{N}$。比值 $\\approx \\num{2.3e39}$：", "电磁相互作用把原子束缚在一起。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:fundamental-interactions:8}", "通过接触，电荷均分：$q_A = q_B = \\qty{+4.0e-9}{C}$（总量", "仍为 $\\qty{8.0e-9}{C}$）。于是", "$F = \\num{8.99e9} \\times (\\num{4.0e-9})^2/0.10^2 =", "\\qty{1.4e-5}{N}$，相互排斥（同号）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:fundamental-interactions:9}", "$d = \\sqrt{k q^2/F} = \\sqrt{\\num{8.99e9} \\times \\num{1.0e-12}/0.90}", "\\approx \\qty{0.10}{m}$。若力缩小为原来的 $9$ 分之一，则距离需为原来的 $3$", "倍：$d = \\qty{0.30}{m}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:fundamental-interactions:10}", "$F = \\num{2.30e-28}/(\\num{1.0e-10})^2 = \\qty{2.3e-8}{N}$。强", "相互作用无贡献：$10^{-10}$~m 是其作用范围的 $10^{5}$ 倍。", "分子由电磁相互作用束缚。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:fundamental-interactions:11}", "$q = \\num{e23}/\\num{e6} \\times \\num{1.6e-19} = \\qty{1.6e-2}{C}$，每", "枚硬币上。$F = \\num{8.99e9} \\times (\\num{1.6e-2})^2/1.0^2 \\approx", "\\qty{2.3e6}{N}$ ——即重量为 $\\num{2.3e6}/9.81 \\approx", "\\qty{2.3e5}{kg}$（一列满载的货运列车），仅来自百万分之一的", "电子。日常物质必须（而且确实）呈电中性，精度远高于", "百万分之一。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:fundamental-interactions:12}", "$F = \\num{2.30e-28}/(\\num{1.4e-14})^2 = \\num{2.30e-28}/\\num{1.96e-28}", "\\approx \\qty{1.2}{N}$ ——在此尺度上仍然极大。不，它们", "相距为强相互作用范围的 $14$ 倍；每个核子只与最近的", "邻居粘合。质子对共 $\\frac{92 \\times 91}{2} = 4186$ 个，\\emph{全部}", "在任意距离上都相互排斥，而粘合力不随尺寸增大。", "中子只增加吸引而不增加排斥，并稀释质子；但", "排斥力随质子数的平方增长，而粘合力只随", "近邻数增长。因此质子数超过约 $80$ 后，任何中子", "数都无法使账目平衡——此类原子核会衰变", "（见\\cref{ch:g11:nucleus-radioactivity}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:fundamental-interactions:13}", "平衡：竖直方向 $T\\cos\\theta = mg$，水平方向", "$T\\sin\\theta = F$，因此 $F = mg\\tan\\theta$。此处", "$\\sin\\theta = 3.0/50 = 0.060$，小角度时", "$\\tan\\theta \\approx \\sin\\theta = 0.060$。于是", "$F = \\num{1.0e-3} \\times 9.81 \\times 0.060 \\approx \\qty{5.9e-4}{N}$;", "$q = d\\sqrt{F/k} = 0.060 \\times \\sqrt{\\num{5.9e-4}/\\num{8.99e9}}", "\\approx \\qty{1.54e-8}{C}$; $N = \\num{1.54e-8}/\\num{1.6e-19} \\approx", "\\num{9.6e10}$ 个元电荷。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:fundamental-interactions:14}", "$F = \\num{6.67e-11} \\times \\num{5.97e24} \\times \\num{7.35e22} /", "(\\num{3.84e8})^2 = \\num{2.93e37}/\\num{1.47e17} \\approx \\qty{2.0e20}{N}$.", "设 $kQ^2/d^2 = F$：", "$Q = d\\sqrt{F/k} = \\num{3.84e8} \\times \\sqrt{\\num{2.0e20}/\\num{8.99e9}}", "\\approx \\qty{5.7e13}{C}$。即", "$N = \\num{5.7e13}/\\num{1.6e-19} \\approx \\num{3.6e32}$ 个电子，其", "质量为 $\\num{3.6e32} \\times \\num{9.11e-31} \\approx \\qty{3.2e2}{kg}$：", "约几百千克的电子，就能起到相当于", "$\\qty{7.35e22}{kg}$ 的月球那样的作用——电的强大与引力的", "微弱，尽在这一个数之中。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}